  "id": "relatedness",
  "term": "relatedness",
  "definition": "Relatedness, in this packet, means a person’s felt connection with nature and living things across cognitive, emotional, and lived experience. Stronger nature relatedness is linked to a greater sense of belonging, more concern for the environment, and more environmentally responsible behavior.",
